00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.169
♪ [vocalizing] ♪

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:05.805 align:start position:0%
Hey, I just got a text
from Charles, y'all.

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:08.141 align:start position:0%
