00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:18.151
- In text.
- Okay, okay.

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:19.385
Well, if that's
what Charles said--

00:00:19.485 --> 00:00:21.054
(woman)
Yeah, that's okay.
We got this.

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:22.488
- We can do this.
- [humming tone] We can do this.

00:00:22.588 --> 00:00:23.722
We can do this.
Come on, y'all.

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:24.991
- [humming tone]
- [humming tone]

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:27.460
♪ Five, six, seven, eight ♪

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:28.828
(all)
♪ We lift up to the Lord ♪

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:32.031
♪ We give praise
up to the Lord ♪

00:00:32.131 --> 00:00:34.867
♪ We sing merrily
up to the Lord ♪

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:37.337
♪ Give thanks up to the Lord ♪

00:00:37.437 --> 00:00:39.505
♪ We lift up to the Lord ♪

00:00:39.605 --> 00:00:41.974
♪ We give praise
up to the Lord ♪

00:00:42.074 --> 00:00:44.843
♪ We sing merrily
up to the Lord ♪

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:47.347
♪ Give thanks up to the Lord ♪

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:49.482
- ♪ I think you're
off of your note ♪

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:52.118
♪ You're going
higher than your note ♪

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:54.554
- ♪ Pretty sure
this is my note ♪

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:57.022
♪ In fact, I'm positive
this is my note ♪

00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:59.391
- ♪ Because this is my note ♪

00:00:59.491 --> 00:01:02.027
- ♪ Pretty sure
this is my note ♪

