00:01:18.911 --> 00:01:21.480
- ♪ You are not Charles ♪

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:23.783
- ♪ I never said
that I was Charles ♪

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:26.319
- ♪ Well, you're acting
like you think you're Charles ♪

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:27.920
- ♪ Look, I know
that I'm not Charles ♪

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:30.222
- ♪ You can say that again ♪

00:01:30.322 --> 00:01:33.526
- ♪ Well, you're both
off your notes ♪

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:36.629
