is about you, Gina ♪

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:51.978
Huh.
♪ Kiss my black ass! ♪

00:01:52.078 --> 00:01:57.116
(all)
♪ Oh, dear Lord ♪

00:01:57.216 --> 00:01:59.718
♪ Where is ♪

00:01:59.818 --> 00:02:05.057
